FINAL SCORECARD
============================================================================
    tool              overhead   accuracy usability   verdict
    wall_nosync           1.00       15.1      2.20   looks fast because it misses the async GPU tail - never ship this
    wall_sync             1.00       98.7      2.65   right total, no attribution; the baseline everything else is checked against
    cProfile              1.00          -      3.00   sees the CPU launch cost of aten ops; blind to kernels
    py-spy                1.00          -      3.15   near-zero-cost CPU view of the launch side; attach to live processes
    torch.profiler        1.32       65.7      4.70   per-kernel GPU times + CPU ops + chrome trace; in-process
    nsys                  1.01       65.8      4.25   whole-process CPU+GPU timeline, near-zero overhead, CSV stats
    ncu                      -          -      4.10   per-kernel hardware metrics (throughput %, occupancy); needs counter permission + replay

